            "content_html": "<div><style>\n.film-project {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 25px auto;\n}\n\n.film-project-video {\n    width: 100%;\n    container-type: inline-size;\n    background: #000;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.film-project-video iframe {\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: calc(75cqw + 24px);\n    border: 0;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\n.film-project-details {\n    padding-top: 24px;\n    max-width: 850px;\n}\n\n.film-project-details h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n    color: #c8ad82;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 1.5px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.film-project-details p {\n    margin: 0 0 18px;\n    color: #d0cec9;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n.film-project-details ul {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 18px;\n    color: #d0cec9;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"film-project\">\n\n    <div class=\"film-project-video\">\n        <div class=\"post__iframe\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\"             src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DBCnY-V8A9Cbbh1fYKzyo6KRsqHe0KrO/preview\"\n            allow=\"autoplay\"\n            allowfullscreen>\n        </iframe></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"film-project-details\">\n\n        <h3>Project Overview</h3>\n        <p>\n            A T20 Cricket World Cup anthem created for Baazi Games.\n            The project involved developing an original rap and\n            musical composition to capture the energy and excitement\n            surrounding T20 cricket.\n        </p>\n\n        <h3>My Contribution</h3>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Lyrics and songwriting</li>\n            <li>Music composition</li>\n            <li>Vocal performance</li>\n            <li>Audio mixing</li>\n            <li>Audio mastering</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <p>\n            The video visuals were produced by a separate agency.\n            My contribution was focused on the complete audio\n            creation and production.\n        </p>\n\n    </div>\n</div></div>",
