            "summary": "Project Overview A collection of social media content developed for AAP Bihar,&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--full\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"5\" data-is-empty=\"false\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-1.jpg\" data-size=\"1024x512\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-1-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"384\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-2.jpg\" data-size=\"1280x1280\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-2-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-3.jpg\" data-size=\"1003x617\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-3-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"472\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-4.jpg\" data-size=\"1003x619\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-4-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"474\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-5.jpg\" data-size=\"1001x615\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-5-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"472\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-6.jpg\" data-size=\"996x614\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-6-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"473\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-7.jpg\" data-size=\"1000x616\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-7-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"473\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-8.jpg\" data-size=\"1280x615\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://\tkartikayashivomrania.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/50/gallery/AAP-Tweet-8-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"369\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"aap-project\">\n<div class=\"aap-project-section\">\n<h3>Project Overview</h3>\n<p>A collection of social media content developed for AAP Bihar, comprising over 100 tweets. The work involved researching relevant subjects and developing written content for the organisation's social media communication. The six samples featured here represent a selection from the larger body of work.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"aap-project-divider\"> </div>\n<div class=\"aap-project-section\">\n<h3>My Contribution</h3>\n<p>I was responsible for researching topics, gathering relevant information and writing the tweets. My role covered research and copywriting across the collection of 100+ social media posts.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
